<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italy CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italy CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a seventh tranche of 1.5 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 3.45 percent.</p>
<p>		   May 1, 2004 CCT		Pvs</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   6.16 pct		6.12 pct</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 7.05 pct		7.01 pct</p>
<p>    Assigned price   99.25		   99.00</p>
<p>    Total bids	  7.291 trln lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	    1.500 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are with a previous auction on May 29.</p>
</text>
